        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So I know we do not have a core rulebook out yet for this game. But, I thought it would be fun to try and create what we think different heroes and villains may be. We can discuss and build them together to use in our own campaigns and such. So, &nbsp;I would want to start with the classic Baron Blade.</p><p><strong>Baron Blade&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Principles:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Collections&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Powers&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">D6: Awareness</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">D8</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">D8</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">D12</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Qualities&nbsp;</strong></p><p>D8: Doombringer&nbsp;</p><p>D8</p><p>D10</p><p>D8</p><p>D10</p><p>D8&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Health&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Green&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Yellow&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Red&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So how would you build Baron Blade? What principles, powers, and qualities would he have? How would you build his abilities?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
