        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-07T14:41:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll bite on a little bit:</p><p><strong>Principle of Obsession:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>You are a known supervillain, sworn to tear down America's Finest Legacy.</p><p>Minor Twist:&nbsp; How does your tenuous alliance with the Freedom Five inconvenience you?&nbsp;</p><p>Major Twist:&nbsp; How do you resist taking the opportunity to slay Legacy once and for all?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Principle of the Baron:</strong></p><p>You are the benevolent leader of Mordengrad, the land of your father and a realm of technological marvels.</p><p>Minor Twist:&nbsp; How do your duties as Baron of Mordengrad interfere with your current schemes?</p><p>Major Twist:&nbsp; What threat to your homeland has emerged, which requires your undivided wrath?</p>",
